# Example environment variables for local development
# Copy this file to `.env` and replace placeholder values with your project-specific values.

# Supabase
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=your-publishable-key

# Notes:
# - Do NOT commit a real `.env` file with secrets. Keep `.env` in .gitignore.
# - The app will run without Supabase, but features that depend on Supabase (Functions, DB) will be disabled or fall back to localStorage.
# - For CI/tests that need Supabase, provide these env vars in your CI environment instead of committing them.
